<title>UK: LME - warehouse stock movements.</title>
<headline>LME - warehouse stock movements.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Apr 23 - Latest LME warehouse stock changes are:</p>
<p>copper down 1025, tin down 45, lead up 350, zinc down 1250, aluminium down 5225, nickel down 240, aluminium alloy down 540</p>
</text>
